description	"Nova Trooper

Elite Precision Heavy Gunners with effective frontline potential.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 15% Faster Movement
- RK-3 Blaster PIstol (3)
-- 60% Slower RoF
-- 20% More damage/FP Drain
-- 40% More Velocity
- E-11S Blaster Rifle (3)
-- Based On WESTAR-M5
-- 25% Slower RoF
-- 10% More Damage/FP Drain
-- 20% More Velocity
- Thermite Cannon (1)
-- Based on PLX
-- 50% Less Damage
-- Ignites/Blinds/Knocksback
-- Heavyweight
- Thermal Bore Rifle (1)
-- Disruptor Rifle
-- 20% More Damage/FP Drain
-- 25% Faster RoF
-- Cripples On Hit
-- Mag Reload
- Pulse Grenades (2)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- 10% less knockback taken
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (1)
- Blast Armor
- Assemble (3)
- Anti MT (1)
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS3]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS2]
- Grapplehook (1) ^3[CS4]"